{
 "format": "damap",
 "version": 1,
 "id": "99c",
 "name": "Aesry Necropolis",
 "file": "Map99c_Aesry_Necropolis.xml",
 "rooms": [
  {"id":1,"x":40,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Gate","descriptions":["Water sparkles as the sun plays off the surface of a small pond just within the cemetery gates.  A wooden bridge with ornamental railings provides safe passage across the water.  The branches of the weeping willows bordering the pond tremble gracefully beneath the weight of small birds that make their home here, while fish rise to the surface to nibble on the pale green leaves which trail along the water.","Water shimmers as the moonlight plays off the surface of a small pond just within the cemetery gates.  A wooden bridge with ornamental railings provides safe passage across the water.  The branches of the weeping willows bordering the pond sway gracefully in the current as the rhythmic chirps of crickets echo through the still night air."],"exits":[{"to":2,"exit":"go","move":"go white gate"},{"to":3,"exit":"go","move":"go small bridge"}]},
  {"id":2,"x":20,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Outside the Necropolis","descriptions":["The trail of crushed shells ends at an elegant white wrought-iron gate marking the entrance to the island's cemetery.  A bridge spanning a small pond of deep blue water, visible through the bars of the gate, lies not far beyond it."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"linksTo":"Map99_Aesry_Town.xml"},
  {"id":3,"x":60,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, On the Bridge","descriptions":["The bridge arcs high above the pond, providing an excellent view of the outer cemetery.  Below, the pond water is almost crystal clear, clear enough to view the fish swimming within.  A row of majestic oak trees line either side of the trail that leads deeper into the cemetery, while a bed of freshly planted daisies and daffodils line the path back to the gate."],"exits":[{"to":1,"exit":"go","move":"go gate path"},{"to":4,"exit":"go","move":"go trail"}]},
  {"id":4,"x":80,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis","descriptions":["The trail ends at the base of a short stairway leading up to the main cemetery.  Massive granite gargoyles perch atop marble pedestals at the base of the stair, their lifeless eyes gazing impassively around the area.  Marigolds grow in clay pots on each step, providing a splash of color against the white marble stairs.  At the top of the stairs, a few headstones are barely visible on the hillside."],"exits":[{"to":3,"exit":"go","move":"go small bridge"},{"to":5,"exit":"climb","move":"climb short stairway"}]},
  {"id":5,"x":80,"y":300,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis","descriptions":["A thin path winds its way from the top of the stairs through the grounds of the necropolis.  The glossy black tile roof of a mausoleum is visible in the distance, though the weeping willow trees which line the path obstruct the view of most of the building.  Freshly planted flowers grow in colorful profusion throughout the area."],"exits":[{"to":6,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":4,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stone stairs"}]},
  {"id":6,"x":100,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis","descriptions":["Octagonal white bricks are fitted tightly together to form the path which leads from the top of the stairs to the main cemetery.  A narrow trail covered with grey marble gravel branches off toward a nearby mausoleum.  Meandering clusters of vibrant yellow tulips are planted alongside the path."],"exits":[{"to":7,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":5,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":10,"exit":"go","move":"go trail"}]},
  {"id":7,"x":120,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis","descriptions":["The white octagonal brick path winds through carefully tended flowerbeds toward the main cemetery.  Nearby, weeping willows spread their branches protectively over a secluded sitting area, shading some benches and providing visitors respite from the elements.  Though some of the bricks are broken, and moss grows between the cracks, the overall impression is one of peace."],"exits":[{"to":8,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":6,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":8,"x":140,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis","descriptions":["To the northeast, the main gate of the cemetery is barely visible through a copse of dogwood trees.  A peaceful calm permeates the area as a soft breeze gently floats through the trees.  The lawns here are a deep plush green grass that is well tended and soft to the touch."],"exits":[{"to":9,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":7,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":9,"x":160,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis","descriptions":["The white brick path stops at an ornate fence that encircles the necropolis.  Made of black and white iron rods, the fence is broken by an elaborately wrought gate.  Beyond the gate, the brick path spirals off deeper into the cemetery, winding amongst the headstones."],"exits":[{"to":8,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":30,"exit":"climb","move":"climb gate"},{"to":30,"exit":"climb","move":"climb ornate gate"}]},
  {"id":10,"x":80,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Outside the Mausoleum","descriptions":["The trail leads up to the entrance of the mausoleum.  Highly polished white marble columns on either side of the entrance support a small overhang that shades the doorway.  A glossy black tile roof protects the occupants from the elements, completing the simple elegance of the structure."],"exits":[{"to":11,"exit":"go","move":"go mausoleum"},{"to":6,"exit":"go","move":"go winding trail"}]},
  {"id":11,"x":60,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Mausoleum Grand Foyer","descriptions":["Polished floors made from black marble reflect the light emanating from several candles placed in tall brass candelabras.  Two divans rest against the far wall underneath a large painting of the inner lake.  An arched doorway made of carved oak leads into the gela oleni, or the main burial chambers."],"exits":[{"to":10,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":12,"exit":"go","move":"go arched doorway"}]},
  {"id":12,"x":60,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Gela Oleni","descriptions":["Walls of black marble shine with such a high gloss, reflections are seen with almost crystal clarity.  Images of flowers are etched into portions of the marble, and grooves are cut at evenly spaced intervals, outlining each individual resting place.  Each grave is a large two foot square, just enough room to hold the urn of a resident.  A door, made from the same marble as the walls, stands slightly ajar."],"exits":[{"to":11,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":13,"exit":"go","move":"go marble door"}]},
  {"id":13,"x":60,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a Mausoleum, Behind the Door","descriptions":["The only thing visible in the dark is a staircase that leads down to the cellar of the mausoleum.  Faint sounds echo below, disturbing the silence with restless tones and thumps."],"exits":[{"to":12,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":14,"exit":"climb","move":"climb staircase"}]},
  {"id":14,"x":60,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a Mausoleum, Crematorium","descriptions":["The room is dark and windowless.  The only means of light is one lone candle that flickers in the far corner.  A large steel oven, its doors slightly ajar, takes up almost all of the floor space.  A faint smell of something indistinguishable fills the air, unpleasant to the nose.  An occasional bumping sound appears to come from the general direction of the far wall."],"exits":[{"to":13,"exit":"climb","move":"climb staircase"},{"to":15,"exit":"go","move":"go wall"}]},
  {"id":15,"x":100,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Tunnels","descriptions":["The tunnels branch off into several directions, leading deeper into the unknown.  Ancient S'Kra symbols are carved into the marble wall that leads back out towards the cellar.  Indistinguishable sounds echo throughout the darkness, coming from all directions."],"exits":[{"to":16,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":18,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":19,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":22,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":14,"exit":"go","move":"go marble wall"}]},
  {"id":16,"x":100,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Tunnels","descriptions":["Ancient S'Kra symbols are carved into the tunnel walls in a continuous line, their meaning indecipherable to the common eye.  The darkness of the tunnel is broken by a single lantern that casts just enough light to make traveling through the tunnels easier."],"exits":[{"to":17,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":15,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":17,"x":120,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Tunnels","descriptions":["Ancient S'Kra symbols are carved into the tunnel walls in a continuous line, their meaning indecipherable to the common eye.  The darkness of the tunnel is broken by a single lantern that casts just enough light to make traveling through the tunnels easier."],"exits":[{"to":20,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":18,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":16,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":18,"x":120,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Tunnels","descriptions":["Ancient S'Kra symbols are carved into the tunnel walls in a continuous line, their meaning indecipherable to the common eye.  The darkness of the tunnel is broken by a single lantern that casts just enough light to make traveling through the tunnels easier."],"exits":[{"to":17,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":20,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":21,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":19,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":15,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":19,"x":120,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Tunnels","descriptions":["Ancient S'Kra symbols are carved into the tunnel walls in a continuous line, their meaning indecipherable to the common eye.  The darkness of the tunnel is broken by a single lantern that casts just enough light to make traveling through the tunnels easier."],"exits":[{"to":18,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":21,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":22,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":15,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":20,"x":140,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Tunnels","descriptions":["Ancient S'Kra symbols are carved into the tunnel walls in a continuous line, their meaning indecipherable to the common eye.  The darkness of the tunnel is broken by a single lantern that casts just enough light to make traveling through the tunnels easier."],"exits":[{"to":18,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":17,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":21,"x":140,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Tunnels","descriptions":["Ancient S'Kra symbols are carved into the tunnel walls in a continuous line, their meaning indecipherable to the common eye.  The darkness of the tunnel is broken by a single lantern that casts just enough light to make traveling through the tunnels easier."],"exits":[{"to":22,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":19,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":18,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":22,"x":120,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Tunnels","descriptions":["Ancient S'Kra symbols are carved into the tunnel walls in a continuous line, their meaning indecipherable to the common eye.  The darkness of the tunnel is broken by a single lantern that casts just enough light to make traveling through the tunnels easier."],"exits":[{"to":19,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":21,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":15,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":23,"exit":"go","move":"go arched doorway"}]},
  {"id":23,"x":120,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Tunnels","descriptions":["Ancient S'Kra symbols are carved into the tunnel walls in a continuous line, their meaning indecipherable to the common eye.  The darkness of the tunnel is broken by a single lantern that casts just enough light to make traveling through the tunnels easier."],"exits":[{"to":24,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":27,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":26,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":22,"exit":"go","move":"go arched doorway"}]},
  {"id":24,"x":140,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Tunnels","descriptions":["Ancient S'Kra symbols are carved into the tunnel walls in a continuous line, their meaning indecipherable to the common eye.  The darkness of the tunnel is broken by a single lantern that casts just enough light to make traveling through the tunnels easier."],"exits":[{"to":25,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":23,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":25,"x":140,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Tunnels","descriptions":["Ancient S'Kra symbols are carved into the tunnel walls in a continuous line, their meaning indecipherable to the common eye.  The darkness of the tunnel is broken by a single lantern that casts just enough light to make traveling through the tunnels easier."],"exits":[{"to":24,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":27,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":26,"x":100,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Tunnels","descriptions":["Ancient S'Kra symbols are carved into the tunnel walls in a continuous line, their meaning indecipherable to the common eye.  The darkness of the tunnel is broken by a single lantern that casts just enough light to make traveling through the tunnels easier."],"exits":[{"to":23,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":29,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":28,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":27,"x":120,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Tunnels","descriptions":["Ancient S'Kra symbols are carved into the tunnel walls in a continuous line, their meaning indecipherable to the common eye.  The darkness of the tunnel is broken by a single lantern that casts just enough light to make traveling through the tunnels easier."],"exits":[{"to":23,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":25,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":29,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":28,"x":80,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Tunnels","descriptions":["Ancient S'Kra symbols are carved into the tunnel walls in a continuous line, their meaning indecipherable to the common eye.  The darkness of the tunnel is broken by a single lantern that casts just enough light to make traveling through the tunnels easier."],"exits":[{"to":26,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":29,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":29,"x":100,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Tunnels","descriptions":["Ancient S'Kra symbols are carved into the tunnel walls in a continuous line, their meaning indecipherable to the common eye.  The darkness of the tunnel is broken by a single lantern that casts just enough light to make traveling through the tunnels easier."],"exits":[{"to":26,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":27,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":28,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":30,"x":180,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["Sweeping green lawns are well manicured and lovingly tended.  Leading into the distance, headstones cast shadows across the dark green grass.  The fragrance of flowers drifts on the breeze, and weeping willows drape their branches over the tombstones."],"exits":[{"to":31,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":9,"exit":"climb","move":"climb iron gate"}]},
  {"id":31,"x":220,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["The white brick path forks off towards the northeast and northwest to encircle the necropolis.  Several headstones lie alongside the path, including a heart-shaped one which attests to a couple who are joined in death as they were in life, while next to it, a tiny marker has been etched with the image of a smiling baby.  The flowers that decorated the headstones are faded and rotting with a dark smeared slime."],"exits":[{"to":32,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":30,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":43,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":32,"x":240,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["The call of a night bird erupts in the distance.  Paths wind through the lawns, and benches lurk beneath veiling trees.  A marbled-granite gargoyle rests gently upon a large slab of granite marking the remains of one of the islanders."],"exits":[{"to":33,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":31,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":33,"x":260,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["Torches line the brick path winding its way through the neatly tended headstones.  A mound of dirt lies next to the beginnings of a freshly-made hole, soon to be a tomb to house yet another resident."],"exits":[{"to":34,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":32,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":34,"x":280,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["The sound of trickling water comes from a nearby marble fountain surrounded by a bed of daisies.  Some of the daisies are trampled and uprooted, and the earth scratched and furrowed."],"exits":[{"to":35,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":33,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":35,"x":300,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["Two sprawling weeping willow trees loom over the path like sentinels on watch.  Dirt piles border a freshly dug grave only partially filled with dirt.  Granite headstones, aligned in evenly spaced rows, cast shadows across the lawn."],"exits":[{"to":36,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":34,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":36,"x":300,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["A shovel and pickaxe lie tumbled upon the grass at the edge of a half-dug grave.  Fresh flowers, their petals scattered by careless feet, sprawl amidst the broken ruins of clay pots.  Nearby, a chisel is half-buried in the soft earth beneath an overturned headstone."],"exits":[{"to":37,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":35,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":37,"x":300,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["A gentle breeze is the only discernible movement in this quiet part of the cemetery.  Soft grass blankets the ground around the older headstones of those buried long ago.  The graves are aged, but still very well maintained.  The scent of honeysuckle from the nearby vines fills the air."],"exits":[{"to":36,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":38,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":44,"exit":"climb","move":"climb iron gate"}]},
  {"id":38,"x":220,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["Headstones run in neat rows, the dates in the inscriptions indicating that those who rest here are among the most recent arrivals in the necropolis.  Neat rectangles of bare dirt covered by wilting flowers mark the newly interred, their headstones lying beside the grave awaiting the mason and his helpers to set them into place."],"exits":[{"to":37,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":39,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":39,"x":200,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["At a bend in the path, a square tomb stands shaded by a young willow tree.  The stone is dusty and stained with watermarks forlornly patterned like tear drops spilled upon it.  The tree branches scrape against it in the wind, neither a screech nor a sigh, but the sound is unsettling."],"exits":[{"to":38,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":40,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":40,"x":200,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["The bridge over the small pond is visible in the distance as the white brick path wends its way through the necropolis.  A freshly dug hole awaits yet another islander who has recently crossed over to the starry road."],"exits":[{"to":39,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":41,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":41,"x":200,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["The deep green lawn is well cared for, the grass thick and lush underfoot.  Modest grey slate markers adorn most of the graves, but a few ostentatious gilt-trimmed white alabaster monuments are scattered here and there.  Weeping willows stand over the path, their long branches blowing in a soft breeze."],"exits":[{"to":40,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":42,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":42,"x":200,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["The path continues its way around the necropolis, weaving through row after row of marble headstones.  A brook gurgles in the darkness, and the overly sweet smell of flowers mingles with a scent of decay."],"exits":[{"to":41,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":43,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":43,"x":200,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["The path curves southeast toward the entrance to the necropolis.  The black tile roof of a mausoleum stands silhouetted in a gap in the trees along the walk.  The grass between the rows of headstones is dark and slick with wetness."],"exits":[{"to":42,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":31,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":44,"x":280,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["Grass overgrows sections of the path as it winds deeper through the necropolis.  Some of the headstones are hundreds of years old and worn from the water and freezing rains of passing generations.  Not a single inscription upon them is readable."],"exits":[{"to":60,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":45,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":37,"exit":"climb","move":"climb iron gate"}]},
  {"id":45,"x":260,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["An onyx tombstone, carved with a panther and trimmed with polished gold leaf, attests to the riches acquired by the mage buried here.  The panther crouches, ready to attack anyone who might disturb its master's eternal rest."],"exits":[{"to":44,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":46,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":46,"x":240,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["The lawn is covered by a deep green carpet of grass, virtually untouched by any worker's spade.  A few headstones are scattered here and there, marking the graves of recently deceased islanders, but for the most part, this area remains unpopulated."],"exits":[{"to":47,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":45,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":47,"x":260,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["At the base of a hill, a dirt path climbs upwards to another section of the grounds.  The white octagonal tiles of the paved walk, here dulled to a dingy shade of grey from the eroded soil of the barren hillside, carry the path on to the southwest.  The bordering trees creak and sway in the darkness as some unseen animal forages and stirs beneath the concealing shadows."],"exits":[{"to":46,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":48,"exit":"up","move":"up"}]},
  {"id":48,"x":240,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["The trail climbs the slope, and is steep enough here to be slippery in wet weather and slick with dust and grit on dry days.  A single clump of weeds grows around a large boulder, the only landmark nearby."],"exits":[{"to":49,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":47,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":49,"x":220,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["A dirt trail ends here where it meets the bricked path, with the paved path leading back into the trees to the north.  Down the slope, the trail winds towards the grounds' pond and gate.  The grassless soil is hard and rocky, but broken by scratches and furrows dug into the ungiving ground.  The dark forested eastern slope rises as a backdrop against this treeless section of the necropolis."],"exits":[{"to":50,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":48,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":50,"x":220,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["The soil is rocky and coarse, and what grass there is, is thin and scraggly.  The path begins to slope downward to the south, heading towards the main entrance."],"exits":[{"to":51,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":49,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":51,"x":220,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["Weeds sprout throughout the lawn, yet the bricked path is surprisingly free of growth.  Few headstones survive here, and the ones which do, are worn by the weather or cracked and broken by vandals... or worse."],"exits":[{"to":52,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":50,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":52,"x":240,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["Dandelions and scraggly weeds claim the lawn here in the farthest corner of the grounds.  Thin headstones of dark grey slate are canted at severe angles, nearly hidden in the ragged greenery.  Several markers near the base of an oak tree lie toppled, with moist scars of earth at their bases."],"exits":[{"to":53,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":51,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":53,"x":260,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["The path winds through a copse of slender birch trees, the mottled white bark a pallid contrast to the dark grass.  The trees tremble and shudder with every gust of breeze, their leaves and twigs in a dancing frenzy."],"exits":[{"to":54,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":52,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":54,"x":280,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["A tall vase of lilies lies knocked on its side near a simple headstone.  The grass is uprooted and marred with long scratch marks, but the subtle scent of lilies dances in the air of a soft breeze."],"exits":[{"to":55,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":53,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":55,"x":280,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["A soft breeze rustles the leaves of the trees, breaking the stillness.  One lone headstone stands underneath a willow tree, crudely chiseled into a half-circle, its surface smoothed over by years of exposure to the elements."],"exits":[{"to":56,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":54,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":56,"x":280,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["Across the necropolis, moonlight glints off the surface of the pond, visible between the trees which shade the white brick path.  Low headstones cluster closely amidst the overgrown grass, covered with a thin layer of moss and worn by time and weather."],"exits":[{"to":57,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":55,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":57,"x":300,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["A gnarled oak shadows a long wooden bench.  The silhouettes of thorny rose bushes and the pattern of weeds growing between the cracks in the path create a sharp contrast of pale and dark.  Sounds of distant voices carry on the wind, but there is no clue as to where these indistinct sounds originate."],"exits":[{"to":58,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":56,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":58,"x":320,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["The willow trees thin out a bit, enough to allow a glimpse of the sky above.  Thickly growing grass, of several different varieties to judge by the variations in color and texture, carpets the ground around you, broken only by tiny purple-tipped white flowers.  Moss-covered headstones, some cracked and broken, line the area -- one of them a massive monument, large enough to mark the grave of an entire family."],"exits":[{"to":59,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":57,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":59,"x":340,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["Weeping willows, planted long ago, now stand tall, their outstretched branches allowing little view of the skies above.  The headstones, thickly clustered along this part of the necropolis, are cracked from age and neglect."],"exits":[{"to":60,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":58,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":60,"x":320,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["The lawn abounds with weeds that even cover some of the tombstones beneath their tangling growth.  The branches of surrounding willow trees meet the tall, unmown grass in a clumsy bow."],"exits":[{"to":59,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":44,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]}
 ],
 "labels": [
